          "jcr:created": "Mon Sep 18 2017 16:58:29 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<h4>ProCare Protect</h4>\n<p>The true value of ProCare isn't the way our people handle equipment service and repairs. It's in the time you'll save and the hassles you won't have to endure. Stryker's ProCare Services was designed to maximize equipment uptime.</p>\n<p>With Stryker’s ProCare Protect contract for Venom electrodes you can:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Save time and increase efficiency by receiving replacement equipment</li>\n<li>Have confidence your equipment will perform up to OEM specifications</li>\n<li>Gain complete service support with Stryker’s dedicated service call center&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 18 2017 16:59:00 GMT-0400",
